        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Add `loading` attribute to audio and video]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29256</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29256"/>
        <updated>2026-03-23T16:06:00.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10931297?u=600cfcb4c4e709dfbc66b328147d846ee87b1e51&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/>
<h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>

<p dir="auto">We're adding <code class="notranslate">loading=lazy</code> to <code class="notranslate">&lt;audio&gt;</code> and <code class="notranslate">&lt;video&gt;</code> attributes!</p>
<p dir="auto">Coming to Chrome in 147 (behind a flag): <a href="https://chromestatus.com/feature/5200068565139456" rel="nofollow">https://chromestatus.com/feature/5200068565139456</a></p>
<p dir="auto">FYI: <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/scottjehl/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/scottjehl">@scottjehl</a>  <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/hjanuschka/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/hjanuschka">@hjanuschka</a></p>
<h4 dir="auto">Test results and supporting details</h4>

<p dir="auto">Audio:<br>
<a href="https://wpt.fyi/results/html/semantics/embedded-content/the-audio-element?label=experimental&amp;label=master&amp;aligned" rel="nofollow">https://wpt.fyi/results/html/semantics/embedded-content/the-audio-element?label=experimental&amp;label=master&amp;aligned</a></p>
<p dir="auto">Video:<br>
<a href="https://wpt.fyi/results/html/semantics/embedded-content/the-video-element?label=experimental&amp;label=master&amp;aligned" rel="nofollow">https://wpt.fyi/results/html/semantics/embedded-content/the-video-element?label=experimental&amp;label=master&amp;aligned</a></p>

<p dir="auto"><a href="https://chromestatus.com/feature/5200068565139456" rel="nofollow">https://chromestatus.com/feature/5200068565139456</a></p>
<p dir="auto">Implementation bugs:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Chrome: <a href="https://crbug.com/469111735" rel="nofollow">https://crbug.com/469111735</a> -</li>
<li>Firefox: <a href="https://bugzil.la/2005072" rel="nofollow">https://bugzil.la/2005072</a> (being implemented at: <a href="https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D278547" rel="nofollow">https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D278547</a>)</li>
<li>Safari: <a href="https://webkit.org/b/303995" rel="nofollow">https://webkit.org/b/303995</a> (being implemented at: <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3917729684" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/issues/58220" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/WebKit/WebKit/pull/58220/hovercard" href="https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/pull/58220">WebKit/WebKit#58220</a>)</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">Firefox and Safari implementations are being actively worked on but, as per policy, I've left this marked as "experimental" until two implementations land in stable.</p>
<p dir="auto">More details:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><a href="https://scottjehl.com/posts/lazy-media/" rel="nofollow">https://scottjehl.com/posts/lazy-media/</a> (with a demo of it working)</li>
<li><a href="https://www.januschka.com/chromium-video-lazy-loading.html" rel="nofollow">https://www.januschka.com/chromium-video-lazy-loading.html</a></li>
</ul>
<h4 dir="auto">Related issues</h4>

<p dir="auto">See spec updates here: <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3687064326" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/11980" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/whatwg/html/pull/11980/hovercard" href="https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/11980">whatwg/html#11980</a>.</p>
<p dir="auto">Content PR: <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4072910479" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43434" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/pull/43434/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43434">mdn/content#43434</a></p>
<p dir="auto">Makes progress on: <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3968847431" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/mdn/issues/809" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/mdn/issues/809/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/mdn/issues/809">mdn/mdn#809</a></p>
]]></content>
